# Who reviews changes. The last matching line wins, and any one owner on a line can approve.
# Owners only become required reviewers if the ruleset on main turns on "Require review from Code Owners".
# Each team needs write access to this repository, or GitHub ignores it.

# Insights maintains and releases the package
*                                   @ArchwayTrust/insights

